/**
 * Class: payload schemas (`payload-schemas.json`), 4 cases per subscribed type.
 *
 * The class SC-014 and FR-033 need and nothing covers today. Generated by
 * running the real Zod schemas and recording the real parse result, never a
 * predicted one.
 *
 * The fourth case per type is the point of the class: an instance carrying a
 * field a newer client wrote, and the exact bytes that must come back out. A
 * client that deserialises into a struct and re-serialises fails it, which is
 * exactly what it is for (chapter 13 §13.2).
 *
 * Chapter: docs/protocol/13-payload-schemas.md.
 */
